<!-- Hardened runtime with no exceptions: the signEntitlements option of
     `vpk pack` in release.yml. Without it vpk applies its .NET default, which allows
     JIT, unsigned executable memory and DYLD_* variables and turns off
     library validation. PwrRoute needs none of them. -->
